<div class="sc-host" data-sc-name="Homepage Concept - Modern Dark v2" data-dc-tpl="18"><div data-dc-tpl="6" data-c1-root="" style="color: rgb(234, 226, 214); font-family: Barlow, system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; background: rgb(18, 18, 16);">{/* Announcement bar, removed 21 September at the client's request. Homepage only; no
    other page ever had one. heroFold() in Base.astro already measures it as zero when
    it is absent, so the hero simply sits under the header alone. To bring it back,
    delete this comment wrapper and nothing else. See DESIGN-DEBT.md entry 70. */}
